to do that, you know?

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:27.010
And so that's just Anita for you.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:29.410
And I think that's just like a glimpse.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:31.690
And also I forgot to
mention that she's directing

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.903
