00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:40.130
So she's just doing incredible things

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.230
on this campus, right?

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:44.610
And I think that she is
somebody to know and to love.

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:48.886
And so now I have the
pleasure to introduce

00:11:48.886 --> 00:11:51.480
professor Nii Addy.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:56.480
Professor Addy received
his BS at Duke University

00:11:56.520 --> 00:12:00.040
and his PhD here at Yale in neuroscience.

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:03.167
And he's been a Yale
faculty member since 2010.

00:12:03.167 --> 00:12:06.580
And so I'm gonna read
Professors Addy's last research,

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:09.110
'cause it's kinda a
little out of my realm,

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:10.653
but it's super dope.

00:12:11.547 --> 00:12:14.255
(audience laughs)

00:12:14.255 --> 00:12:19.040
So Dr. Addy's research focuses
on neurobiological basis

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:21.930
of substance abuse,
anxiety and depression,

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:23.870
but goals of his research
are to provide new

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:26.890
mechanistic insight into
the psychiatric illnesses

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:31.020
and to identify novel therapeutic
targets for treatment.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.200
Outside of the laboratory,

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.910
Dr. Addy regularly contributes
to science outreach

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:37.020
events from middle and
high school students

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.680
and the general public.

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:40.770
In addition, he serves
in several mentorship

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:43.700
and leadership roles related
to diversity and inclusion,

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.010
both here at Yale and nationally.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.850
He has also had the honor of participating

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:51.520
in multiple college
campuses various forums

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:52.547
on the biological,

00:12:52.547 --> 00:12:57.400
psychological and spiritual
aspects of mental health.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:01.480
So please join me in welcoming
Professor Addy to the stage.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:04.647
(audience applauding)

