00:44:28.480 --> 00:44:30.093
a healthy mental state?

00:44:31.132 --> 00:44:32.110
Are you gonna go first or pass?

00:44:32.110 --> 00:44:32.943
- Oh yeah.

00:44:34.310 --> 00:44:36.426
You are taking the microphone
from a rapper, come on, man.

00:44:36.426 --> 00:44:38.366
